Libron is based on Readerly, which is based on Newsreader.

Greek and Cyrillic coverage is based on Source Serif 4 (https://github.com/adobe-fonts/source-serif), with glyphs adapted to Libron.

Greek diacritics, including accents, breathing marks and iota subscripts, are adapted from Literata (https://github.com/googlefonts/literata).

